  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_3211.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>150 fotos del concierto de Navidad de la Onda Big Band, con m&uacute;sica de Disney y la participaci&oacute;n de la compa&ntilde;&iacute;a Am&iacute;mic Teatre, adem&aacute;s de las cantantes B&aacute;rbara Breva, Alexandra Zamfira, Sofia Royo y Mar&iacute;a Ortega &Aacute;lvaro, por ese orden. Todo ello, junto a la participaci&oacute;n de ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, dirigido por Manolo D&iacute;az.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2974.jpg\" alt=\"img_2974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2975.jpg\" alt=\"img_2975\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2977.jpg\" alt=\"img_2977\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2979.jpg\" alt=\"img_2979\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2980.jpg\" alt=\"img_2980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2981.jpg\" alt=\"img_2981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2983.jpg\" alt=\"img_2983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertondabigbandnadal1617/img_2986.jpg\" alt=\"img_2986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e